  sequenceLabelId: StarOfDavid_EN
  narrativeCategory: 2
  dialogueLines:
  - subtitleText: This stone bears the Shield of David. The Nazis turned this positive
      sign into a symbol of shame and annihilation. But for the survivors in Bergen-Belsen,
      it became a symbol of hope for a self-determined life in the newly established
      State of Israel.
